{"diagram":{"image":{"x":0,"width":200,"y":0,"pngdata":"","height":200},"elements":{"leftChildren":[],"comments":[],"children":[{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[{"parent":"1458b135d642f1a8","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"5e378e970a4a8181","title":"以始为终"},{"parent":"1458b135d642f1a8","children":[{"parent":"4d156f8b0ec068eb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"125cecaf18d5427d","title":"写代码一起写代码。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"4d156f8b0ec068eb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"bebc200c04cf1b8c","title":"锻炼表达能力"},{"parent":"4d156f8b0ec068eb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4620952da969dae8","title":"会定期开组会，有一个分享学习内容，其实也在锻炼沟通表达能力"},{"parent":"4d156f8b0ec068eb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a120a52a4857056c","title":"后期小组的凝聚力是比较强的。&nbsp;碰到问题有后援。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4d156f8b0ec068eb","title":"后期分小组做项目+学习"},{"parent":"1458b135d642f1a8","children":[],"id":"dd9012b43fb5a2b6","title":"快速学习能力"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1458b135d642f1a8","title":"可以自己想一下，工作中需要什么技能。在这几个月，多锻炼。 <br>1.基础知识。上课讲+晚上时候梳理<br>2.实际代码能力。晚自习的时候会敲代码。&nbsp;leetcode。写项目的时候<br>3.找出问题，解决问题的能力。 debug<br>4.沟通能力。 和别人沟通，打交道的能力。 <br>5.写文档能力。<br>"},{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[{"parent":"f3eb2cb00ffe8625","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b14cdb6a1891300b","title":"链表。 <br>同学，简单聊聊链表。 <br>链表，是一个线性表。 是一个离散的线性表， 链表的每个数据可以不装在一起，是靠一个指针指向的下一个数据。 数组是另外一种格式的线性表，它和链表的区别是，它的数据是存在一起的。 <br>链表的插入，就是找到前驱结点。然后挪动前驱结点的指针，靠挪动指针完成插入。 删除也是类似。 查找，没有随机访问的特点，只能一个一个的访问， 最终访问到第n个。 <br>数组的插入， 把后面的数据往后挪一位，然后将要插入的数据放进去。删除，也是挪数据，将数据整体往前挪一位。&nbsp; 查找第n个数据，只需要根据公式直接算出地址，然后直接去该地址取数据。"},{"parent":"f3eb2cb00ffe8625","children":[],"id":"3b4e6d338f174ba9","title":"而且还不能是以背诵的方式，如果是以背诵的方式，基本上面试官一听就知道你是背的。<br>接下来面试官会更换其他的不是背诵能解决的问题。换句话，会用别的方式来试探你的水平"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"f3eb2cb00ffe8625","title":"还有一个。要会回答问题，有些东西你懂，<br>但是无法用语言组织出来。这时候就比较被动。<br>因为面试的时候，你就涉及到这样一个场景。<br>"},{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cf2805704a1bcfa2","title":"图的科普"},{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[{"parent":"e784a69c3f164363","children":[{"parent":"05d0bf882febdf81","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"541427b99e5924c1","title":"核心思想就是：&nbsp;拆块，&nbsp;冗余"},{"parent":"05d0bf882febdf81","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1a0922b70b5c892c","title":"hadoop是一个别人已经实现好的框架（软件）。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"05d0bf882febdf81","title":"hadoop"},{"parent":"e784a69c3f164363","children":[{"parent":"6784c51f5750ad12","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"453c2e0b466b2631","title":"用来解决大数据的计算问题。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6784c51f5750ad12","title":"mapreduce"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e784a69c3f164363","title":"大数据的科普"},{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[{"parent":"6d4e7ef6ba85b097","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"23ace5178d5c119a","title":"用户画像后端开发工程师"},{"parent":"6d4e7ef6ba85b097","children":[{"parent":"5c1db8ff93952aef","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4ccf42241aa553bd","title":"用户年龄在 17-35之间"},{"parent":"5c1db8ff93952aef","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"bae1997bf2610aa8","title":"性别：&nbsp;女"},{"parent":"5c1db8ff93952aef","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4799fc24f0e5b609","title":"现在，你是卖化妆品。&nbsp;需要找到精准的人群，发短信。而不是漫无目的的发"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5c1db8ff93952aef","title":"人群包。就是用来找给谁发短信的。&nbsp;"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6d4e7ef6ba85b097","title":"用户画像系统"},{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[{"parent":"0f850edbfc541cf1","children":[{"parent":"77f41a00e925f951","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"71fd1726123788c0","title":"看文档，动手练。<br>看一些基础点的书<br>刷一下leetcode。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"77f41a00e925f951","title":"1.主动学习。多花点时间学习"},{"parent":"0f850edbfc541cf1","children":[{"parent":"d33f4e38e82bb8b4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"3c677a5ec85aaa08","title":"自己一定要多花时间，肯花时间。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d33f4e38e82bb8b4","title":"2.培训不是交了钱坐这就完事了。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"0f850edbfc541cf1","children":[{"parent":"661583773d394e95","children":[],"id":"a436241264782651","title":"基础好，不错。多刷刷题"},{"parent":"661583773d394e95","children":[],"id":"cbade51788ce4d3e","title":"基础差，多花点时间将代码多敲敲"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"661583773d394e95","title":"3.基础问题"},{"parent":"0f850edbfc541cf1","children":[{"parent":"f281e679a55090d4","children":[],"id":"6c2abfecc173e62d","title":"一定要多敲代码、多练习"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"f281e679a55090d4","title":"4.代码问题"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"0f850edbfc541cf1","title":"关于学习的几个建议"},{"parent":"d2d43e1adf64387f","children":[{"parent":"9cb452e0f8ff7f25","children":[{"parent":"35aef769f60138fe","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8b312b87f20d4f51","title":"一般放视频。&nbsp;笔记也会放，常见的一些软件一般会放在上面"},{"parent":"35aef769f60138fe","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6b450f41d74410b3","title":"内网的网盘。&nbsp;如果回到宿舍，是连不上的"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"35aef769f60138fe","title":"1.winscp"},{"parent":"9cb452e0f8ff7f25","children":[{"parent":"c83d161a90ca9fb3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6f2e0d520861bfd0","title":"视频的。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"c83d161a90ca9fb3","title":"2.百度网盘"},{"parent":"9cb452e0f8ff7f25","children":[{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2bd59e28d5d44564","title":"一般会放代码，笔记，思维导图，图片。"},{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"3c90832c4ef770e7","title":"一般不会放视屏"},{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2ef1cd78a5e71008","title":"01_code&nbsp;放代码的"},{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1101187eada69339","title":"02_note&nbsp;放笔记的，和网页上是一个版本"},{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"03344a68686b8f28","title":"03_review&nbsp;思维导图，笔记。&nbsp;打成pdf"},{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ea34f1fe2db2cccd","title":"04_other&nbsp;其他的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"46bba6b2f1de0804","title":"一般会在群里发截图，大家注意一下路径。&nbsp; git pull&nbsp;一下就可以拉到最新的"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5af0ad50d6d7e4a3","title":"3.gitee上"},{"parent":"9cb452e0f8ff7f25","children":[{"parent":"f7f487da0be3a468","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"20bdf49af6e9d446","title":"学习文档。<br>在gitee上是有一模一样的&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f7f487da0be3a468","title":"4.网页"}],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"9cb452e0f8ff7f25","title":"学习资料的位置"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d2d43e1adf64387f","title":"自我介绍"},{"parent":"root","children":[{"parent":"dbd85663e4bb1244","children":[{"parent":"0b258cf68620c5d8","children":[],"id":"9ac4eabbe95c31df","title":"C易出错，出错提示不友好"},{"parent":"0b258cf68620c5d8","children":[],"id":"aaec27769ef4d4e4","title":"所以调试比较关键"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"0b258cf68620c5d8","title":"C历史。几个C语言的版本了解一下"},{"parent":"dbd85663e4bb1244","children":[{"parent":"0490f8b5c0f0b0e3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"184b10829946c29d","title":"ctrl + k , ctrl +d&nbsp;格式化<br>ctrl +&nbsp; x&nbsp;剪切<br>ctrl + d&nbsp;复制当前行<br>ctrl + shift + /&nbsp;注释"},{"parent":"0490f8b5c0f0b0e3","children":[],"id":"87eef4fcb0abeaf7","title":"模板晚上要配置一下"},{"parent":"0490f8b5c0f0b0e3","children":[],"id":"86e40f4578565386","title":"启动项目，项目右键---配置启动项目---&nbsp;当前选定内容<br>"},{"parent":"0490f8b5c0f0b0e3","children":[],"id":"d55fc5c4a08c57b1","title":"启动的时候，以X86启动。不要以X64启动"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"0490f8b5c0f0b0e3","title":"VS的安装配置。代码模板配置一下。<br>几个快捷键大致了解一下"},{"parent":"dbd85663e4bb1244","children":[{"parent":"cb014c28060bc5f7","children":[{"parent":"25e3dc4c9f70666a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"11d7281f85f582a8","title":"聊到了规范的问题，有一些规范是约定俗成的。<br>不这么写也可以，但是后续在我们写完代码，<br>会比较麻烦"},{"parent":"25e3dc4c9f70666a","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"e7bb57e51e66a57f","title":"规范的问题一定要注意。&nbsp;要养成好的习惯"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"25e3dc4c9f70666a","title":"注释"},{"parent":"cb014c28060bc5f7","children":[{"parent":"f665454cdc5d478d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5dc9d0363e68b6fc","title":"关键字混个眼熟"},{"parent":"f665454cdc5d478d","children":[{"parent":"d0b79f2fc3a2ba2a","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"c6a75827547e10c7","title":"英文"},{"parent":"d0b79f2fc3a2ba2a","children":[{"parent":"2a66449dfe2339af","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8c8ef0d0cc8ba8e7","title":"不光可以解释变量，还可以解释代码。&nbsp;帮助我们理解代码"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"2a66449dfe2339af","title":"见名知意"},{"parent":"d0b79f2fc3a2ba2a","children":[{"parent":"35b3a0d33cae7094","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ff6ddf2afc495e15","title":"C语言我们使用下划线进行分割。"},{"parent":"35b3a0d33cae7094","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"669340c43f188a0c","title":"驼峰：&nbsp;就是多个单词像骆驼峰一样，一高一低。简单说就是单词首字母采用大写。以便程序员能看懂多个单词组合起来"},{"parent":"35b3a0d33cae7094","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"25a7e2251b365477","title":"大驼峰：首单词的首字母是大写"},{"parent":"35b3a0d33cae7094","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1171854cfa77cfad","title":"小驼峰：首单词采用小写"},{"parent":"35b3a0d33cae7094","children":[],"id":"1faa2cbf78ce59da","title":"命名风格，就是多个单词组合在一起的时候，怎么和谐一些。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"35b3a0d33cae7094","title":"命名风格<br>"},{"parent":"d0b79f2fc3a2ba2a","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"8b15320aae48758f","title":"最低要求"},{"parent":"d0b79f2fc3a2ba2a","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"05be1dc28c8e81fd","title":"较高的要求"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d0b79f2fc3a2ba2a","title":"标识符是我们自己给变量取的名字"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f665454cdc5d478d","title":"标识符和关键字"},{"parent":"cb014c28060bc5f7","children":[{"parent":"f509cb7d2e6b5db8","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"830583a90301586f","title":"常量，我们一般使用常量给变量赋值。&nbsp;<br>常见的整数，类型是int。也就是我们写个10。是int类型<br>我们写浮点数，是double类型&nbsp;<br>如果我们希望是float。&nbsp;后面要加f"},{"parent":"f509cb7d2e6b5db8","children":[{"parent":"52fc65dd3c36e750","children":[{"parent":"75adb8bd22aa5f38","children":[{"parent":"169b76eb48f2eb86","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"70ed985effa8aae6","title":"这个是我们刚讲的标识符问题"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"169b76eb48f2eb86","title":"变量名"},{"parent":"75adb8bd22aa5f38","children":[{"parent":"4438aa991abd8358","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ae4aff9235216fbf","title":"一个变量类型，就限制了能进行哪些操作，存储的范围。&nbsp;<br>比如一个int。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4438aa991abd8358","title":"变量类型"},{"parent":"75adb8bd22aa5f38","children":[{"parent":"5cb1505c00bafca4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5747fd3e94ba9f31","title":"给变量初始化值"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5cb1505c00bafca4","title":"变量值"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"75adb8bd22aa5f38","title":"变量有三要素"},{"parent":"52fc65dd3c36e750","children":[{"parent":"998d2e95963ff65d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"0ad07c98cf5db3ac","title":"这个也是我们使用的比较多的变量"},{"parent":"998d2e95963ff65d","children":[{"parent":"1fd6a75594747911","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5a2bd05930326376","title":"就是在{}&nbsp;内部的，局部位置的变量"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1fd6a75594747911","title":"什么是局部变量"},{"parent":"998d2e95963ff65d","children":[{"parent":"6632864e78c74d3b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e0c336e79837d869","title":"局部变量只在{}的局部生效，出了括号就没了。所以大家在使用的时候注意"},{"parent":"6632864e78c74d3b","children":[],"id":"3103862f31ba4ac9","title":"后期的代码中比较复杂的时候，可能大括号内部疯狂嵌套。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"6632864e78c74d3b","title":"作用域"},{"parent":"998d2e95963ff65d","children":[{"parent":"2b8cc5bd1375d403","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ce2bfb9bc0aa757d","title":"如果不给局部变量赋初始值，这时候它的值是随机的。&nbsp;可能是0，可能是其他的，可能是脏数据。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2b8cc5bd1375d403","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"7513cdcffd2e42ab","title":"但是在VS中，它会做一些填充。这时候看到的是一个固定的值。但这只是vs的行为。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"2b8cc5bd1375d403","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"b402e7af238ceb45","title":"一个局部变量，一定建议要初始化再使用。&nbsp;不要使用没有初始化的局部变量。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2b8cc5bd1375d403","title":"默认值"},{"parent":"998d2e95963ff65d","children":[{"parent":"c5b371899cd96ee5","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e109bcf5d7e29d71","title":"在C标准中，没有对这块进行规定。具体的行为就有编译器自行实现，可能是随机值，可能是固定值，<br>可能崩溃，可能编译报错。&nbsp;<br>所以，一定要注意未定义行为，写代码的时候，不要写出这种代码。&nbsp;&nbsp;"},{"parent":"c5b371899cd96ee5","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"5b8161bc742b46c2","title":"一定要小心它"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"18px"},"id":"c5b371899cd96ee5","title":"未定义行为"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"998d2e95963ff65d","title":"我们首先研究局部变量"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"52fc65dd3c36e750","title":"变量"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f509cb7d2e6b5db8","title":"变量和常量"},{"parent":"cb014c28060bc5f7","children":[{"parent":"b052cb820ceca0fb","children":[{"parent":"08c7b36a0baa9a36","children":[],"id":"64f5b376d133e226","title":"函数、方法、钩子"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"08c7b36a0baa9a36","title":"函数的一些类似叫法"},{"parent":"b052cb820ceca0fb","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4b9674a46953fb63","title":"函数定义的语法需要注意"},{"parent":"b052cb820ceca0fb","children":[{"parent":"8cbc96d588790a02","children":[{"parent":"5628866472b21f27","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"1451b3fc7094eb42","title":"就是只有第一行，没有那个大括号。&nbsp;<br>void test1(int num)。这个就是函数头"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5628866472b21f27","title":"函数头"},{"parent":"8cbc96d588790a02","children":[{"parent":"361cf8048cfecf16","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2ff92ba9c9ec0852","title":"就是大括号及内部的内容"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"361cf8048cfecf16","title":"函数体"},{"parent":"8cbc96d588790a02","children":[{"parent":"2a14ef9f5030f988","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6dbac75473673608","title":"函数头加个分号"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"2a14ef9f5030f988","title":"函数声明"},{"parent":"8cbc96d588790a02","children":[{"parent":"d25272c9a6d08bf1","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ac69f8818bae6c11","title":"整个函数就叫做函数定义"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d25272c9a6d08bf1","title":"函数定义"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"8cbc96d588790a02","title":"函数这块的几个概念"},{"parent":"b052cb820ceca0fb","children":[{"parent":"3b78af5cc1fe5c99","children":[{"parent":"bf21128deeccae4d","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"fe3124f9f8343c21","title":"如果有些情况无法挪动位置，可以采用先在上面写一个函数声明。<br>然后位置不用调整<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"bf21128deeccae4d","title":"注意1：被调用的函数，放在上面。不然可能会出现错误。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"3b78af5cc1fe5c99","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f0123e9ddb842bee","title":"注意2：&nbsp;在调用函数的时候，一定要写()。不然不叫函数的调用。<br>拓展：这其实是函数指针，就是一个函数的地址"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"3b78af5cc1fe5c99","title":"函数的几个注意事项"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b052cb820ceca0fb","title":"函数"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cb014c28060bc5f7","title":"超基础语法"},{"parent":"dbd85663e4bb1244","children":[{"parent":"191fb83493345873","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4cffbe91f11c87c7","title":"大致来说，分两步：一步是从源代码变成可执行程序<br>一步是可执行程序被调用运行起来"},{"parent":"191fb83493345873","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6658b8d9b8c5ddea","title":"所以，我们第一步研究怎么从main.c变成可执行程序。&nbsp;<br>第二步我们研究运行起来的内存问题&nbsp;"},{"parent":"191fb83493345873","children":[{"parent":"7223c5170eeadb07","children":[{"parent":"12bb2a4e2890b9c6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9c4ee0b1d34c44fe","title":".c&nbsp;变.i"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"12bb2a4e2890b9c6","title":"预处理"},{"parent":"7223c5170eeadb07","children":[{"parent":"bb94f97931454b4b","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"7017387427145ea3","title":".i&nbsp;变 .s"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"bb94f97931454b4b","title":"编译"},{"parent":"7223c5170eeadb07","children":[{"parent":"8caf396578e8189c","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"aeb2b5de17698048","title":".s&nbsp;变 .o"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8caf396578e8189c","title":"汇编"},{"parent":"7223c5170eeadb07","children":[{"parent":"0213d571f1f078a3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"be0a1b4f393139b1","title":"把.o文件合起来，变成一个可执行程序，<br>在windows里面exe"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"0213d571f1f078a3","title":"链接"},{"parent":"7223c5170eeadb07","children":[{"parent":"a10803fd454a8066","children":[{"parent":"98346cdf4401b6ad","children":[],"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"f69e12069d72dd13","title":"预处理就是将 .c文件&nbsp;转换为 .i文件"},{"parent":"98346cdf4401b6ad","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"7d18b0310598688d","title":"预处理器在执行预处理指令。也会顺手把注释去掉"},{"parent":"98346cdf4401b6ad","children":[{"parent":"c3889a3846d78260","children":[],"id":"bd5685260d3fbf1f","title":"就是做一些配置。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"c3889a3846d78260","children":[],"id":"fa7b0c02bb5fa907","title":"配置完之后，代码无法运行。&nbsp;"}],"collapsed":true,"id":"c3889a3846d78260","title":"要知道怎么看 .i文件。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"98346cdf4401b6ad","children":[{"parent":"742f31664ca32617","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"cf797800dc883756","title":"先理解为复制粘贴，把别的地方的代码，借过来用一下"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"742f31664ca32617","title":"#include&nbsp;就是预处理指令"},{"parent":"98346cdf4401b6ad","children":[{"parent":"5dfd074035212fe3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"da5981fd38411bab","title":"宏定义。&nbsp;文本替换。之前使用宏定义常量的，用真实值替换它"},{"parent":"5dfd074035212fe3","children":[{"parent":"71796d545fed3891","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5c7a646fba1d7d3f","title":"但是需要注意这块的宏函数，在定义的时候，一定要多加点括号"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"71796d545fed3891","title":"宏函数。类似的<br>"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5dfd074035212fe3","title":"#define&nbsp;也是一个"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"98346cdf4401b6ad","title":"预处理"},{"parent":"a10803fd454a8066","children":[{"parent":"68166d7753ba3641","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a1f951734bb36f24","title":"狭义的编译，就是把 .i文件转换为 .s文件"},{"parent":"68166d7753ba3641","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"062a40385ac2df01","title":"编译&nbsp;阶段，会做&nbsp;词法分析、语法分析、检查工作<br>会进行代码优化&nbsp;<br>最终，会生成一个汇编的代码"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"68166d7753ba3641","title":"编译"},{"parent":"a10803fd454a8066","children":[{"parent":"279d6dbaeb1e19bd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9c2455add09a192e","title":"汇编，就是将.s&nbsp;变成 .o文件"},{"parent":"279d6dbaeb1e19bd","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b5b1fb9114643da3","title":"这时候代码，会变成二进制的机器指令，程序员已经无法看懂这块代码了"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"279d6dbaeb1e19bd","title":"汇编"},{"parent":"a10803fd454a8066","children":[{"parent":"5dd1dadfa7119be4","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"e1a799a037476c62","title":"将.o文件和一些外部的库文件，链接起来，最终生成一个可执行程序"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5dd1dadfa7119be4","title":"链接"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a10803fd454a8066","title":"分步骤在做什么事情"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"7223c5170eeadb07","title":"源代码变成可执行程序分为几步"},{"parent":"191fb83493345873","children":[{"parent":"8d050639dada0d63","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"dbc3f3c5a055429a","title":"运行时，我们认为我们看到的内存，是一块连续的，从0开始的，到最大的。<br>这个我们认为是虚拟内存。"},{"parent":"8d050639dada0d63","children":[{"parent":"602ab5c8f0a71c11","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"20ad53a43f37d9c7","title":"这几个问题都是相同的回答方式"},{"parent":"602ab5c8f0a71c11","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"083ed079ead8e922","title":"1.虚拟内存有什么好处"},{"parent":"602ab5c8f0a71c11","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"7fdf49d083f3c331","title":"2.为什么我们不是直接看到的物理内存"},{"parent":"602ab5c8f0a71c11","children":[{"parent":"8da62d1871cb7b08","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"859458d399aeb6d4","title":"先说问题。&nbsp;如果我们直接看到的是物理内存，进程间隔离非常困难。&nbsp;内存碎片难控制，程序员控制内存很困难。&nbsp;<br>现在，我们看到的内存是连续的。这时候操作系统可以帮助我们完成进程间隔离。<br>这时候，我们也不需要理碎片，操作系统帮助我们处理这个事情。<br>程序员只需要知道这块内存是连续的，使用它就可以了&nbsp;"},{"parent":"8da62d1871cb7b08","children":[],"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"22px"},"id":"236d49c7e25ab9a0","title":"知道一个知识很重要。&nbsp;但是能条理清楚的回答清楚一个问题，也非常重要。&nbsp;<br>或者说尤为重要"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"8da62d1871cb7b08","title":"回答方式"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"color":"rgb(231,79,76)","font-weight":"bold","font-size":"16px"},"id":"602ab5c8f0a71c11","title":"大家要知道如果没有这个一个虚拟内存，有什么问题。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"8d050639dada0d63","children":[{"parent":"ae80b59b7bf626b3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"5623c4c729b1dbec","title":"从上而下，分为五部分。<br>这里需要注意一下，是逻辑的关系。有一些编译器可能并没有严格遵循这个顺序。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"ae80b59b7bf626b3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b8ba0832861bd0c2","title":"代码段、数据段、堆、栈、内核区<br>"},{"parent":"ae80b59b7bf626b3","children":[{"parent":"485b974eca1f7ac6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f63afb12c8e11c8d","title":"代码段就是存放代码的地方。比如函数的机器指令"},{"parent":"485b974eca1f7ac6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"14fdd72511873ecd","title":"数据段：&nbsp;存全局变量的位置"},{"parent":"485b974eca1f7ac6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"64cd7869699dead9","title":"堆：&nbsp;动态分配的内存，是在堆区里的"},{"parent":"485b974eca1f7ac6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"46eb6eb929ad7911","title":"栈：&nbsp;存储函数的调用过程"},{"parent":"485b974eca1f7ac6","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"dc0e56690fe7e036","title":"内核区：&nbsp;在涉及到一些系统相关的问题时会用到。&nbsp;比如读取外部的磁盘等"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"485b974eca1f7ac6","title":"知道一下大致的作用"},{"parent":"ae80b59b7bf626b3","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b562f6d4abd6ac2c","title":"堆和栈的大小需要知道一下。&nbsp;堆占的比较大，栈区占用小部分"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"ae80b59b7bf626b3","title":"进程在拿到这样一块内存之后，并不是杂乱无章的使用这样一块内存。<br>&nbsp;而是采用分门别类的方式来使用。"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8d050639dada0d63","title":"运行时的内存问题"},{"parent":"191fb83493345873","children":[{"parent":"4c429a0b509e95be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"35e2038e5b2d25d3","title":"内存地址：就是虚拟内存上某一个字节的唯一性标识"},{"parent":"4c429a0b509e95be","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"f25f94f86b4f135e","title":"变量地址：&nbsp;一个变量也是有地址的，它存储的地址，是变量的首字节地址。<br>比如有一个int类型，一般占用四个字节，存储的时候是首字节地址"},{"parent":"4c429a0b509e95be","children":[{"parent":"6c3087a9f5a56a29","children":[],"id":"376ef4eb396f1f19","title":"&amp;&nbsp;取一个变量的地址"},{"parent":"6c3087a9f5a56a29","children":[],"id":"63bd38648bf06005","title":"int *&nbsp; 这个是指针"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"6c3087a9f5a56a29","title":"int *存储的，就是int类型的首地址。&nbsp;<br>指针，在C里面就是存地址的。&nbsp;"},{"parent":"4c429a0b509e95be","children":[{"parent":"8d4a823d8b7f2b30","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"a828a9c08b61f15a","title":"采用的是小端存储法。数据的低位存储在内存的低地址。"},{"parent":"8d4a823d8b7f2b30","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"d8b597172b8e87e3","title":"大端存储法"},{"parent":"8d4a823d8b7f2b30","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"476bc37fbcb9be49","title":"因为C程序员是需要经常看内存的，如果不知道它的具体存储方式，<br>有可能出现看不懂内存的情况，所以要知道它的存储顺序"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"8d4a823d8b7f2b30","title":"字节顺序"},{"parent":"4c429a0b509e95be","children":[{"parent":"9ec7bde8d2ced2ca","children":[],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"b93de228a3de800b","title":"和应用程序的位数相关。&nbsp;如果32位应用程序，则指针占用4个字节；&nbsp;<br>如果是64位应用程序，则指针占用8个字节<br>4字节=32bit = 8个16进制数<br>8字节=64bit = 16个16进制数"}],"collapsed":true,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"9ec7bde8d2ced2ca","title":"指针大小"}],"collapsed":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"4c429a0b509e95be","title":"内存地址问题"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"191fb83493345873","title":"一个C程序是怎么运行起来的<br>"}],"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"dbd85663e4bb1244","title":"基础知识"}],"root":true,"theme":"{\"background\":\"#ffffff\",\"title\":\"基础曲线\",\"startType\":[],\"marginH\":24,\"marginW\":50,\"childMarginH\":24,\"childMarginW\":16,\"common\":{\"family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"italic\":false,\"textAlign\":\"left\"},\"connectionStyle\":{\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#8A8A8A\",\"color\":\"#ffffff\"},\"centerTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#00A59A\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"font-size\":\"20px\",\"border-radius\":\"12px\",\"padding\":\"13px 20px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"secTopic\":{\"backgroundColor\":\"#EEEEEE\",\"border-radius\":\"10px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"font-size\":\"18px\",\"padding\":\"8px 14px\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"curve\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"font-style\":\"normal\"},\"childTopic\":{\"font-size\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#0D0D0DE5\",\"padding\":\"3px 12px\",\"font-weight\":\"normal\",\"lineStyle\":{\"lineType\":\"roundBroken\",\"lineWidth\":2,\"lineColor\":\"#484848\"},\"font-family\":\"微软雅黑\",\"font-style\":\"normal\",\"border-radius\":\"30px\"},\"id\":\"customise_efe174d4bfb5\"}","showWatermark":false,"style":{"font-size":"16px"},"id":"root","title":"Day01_basic1","version":656,"structure":"mind_free"}},"meta":{"exportTime":"2025-05-14 21:32:09","member":"","diagramInfo":{"creator":"","created":"","modified":"","title":"","category":""},"id":"","type":"ProcessOn Schema File","version":"1.0"}}